Descrição:
Robot arm - TX2-90 Arm - Staubli
Solenoid Valves - 2 solenoid valve pressure 5/3 closed center; 
Arm length - Standard Length; 
Environment - Standard Industrial Ambiance; 
Arm paint - STD paint RAL1028;
Arm mounting - Floor Mounting;
Interco cable exit - Arm Connection Side Exit;
User Connect - IO & Ethernet connectors;
Robot Controller - CS9 For TX2-90; 
Power Supply - MULTI 3x200/230V;
Ethercat Module - 8/8 Digital Remote I/O; 
User Manual - Standard documentation; 
Working mode box - WMS CS9 with 5 m cable; 
Interconnect cable - 5 m std cable with 2 elbow connectors; 
Teach Pendant SP2 - SP2 with 5 m cable and Support; 
Ethercat Module - Coupler with 8in/4out & cap;
Ethercat Module - EtherCAT incremental encoder x2; 
RT Fieldbus - RT Slave Fieldbus to be defined;
RT Fieldbus - RT Slave Ethernet/IP Adapter; 
Field bus - PCIe CCLink Slave1VALtrackVALtrack Runtime License;
VALtrack - VALtrack Runtime License; 
SRS - Stäubli Robotics Suite 2022 (Demo).

